  "title": "Cookie Bar Blondies for a Crowd",
  "description": "This easy chocolate chip cookie bar recipe is a great idea for your next party--it makes two large pans of decadent blondies that your guests will devour.",
  "authors": [
    "alyson_a"
  ],
  "date_published": "2020-03-05T00:19:27-05:00",
